                      '${analysis!.items.length} visible items • ${_foodHubLegacyFormatDateTime(sourceLog!.capturedAt)}',
                  trailing: _FoodHubLegacyStatusChip(
                    label: analysis.status.name,
                    color: analysis.status == FoodAnalysisStatus.complete
                        ? _FoodHubLegacyFoodColors.mint
                        : _FoodHubLegacyFoodColors.warning,
